                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really hate to give this game a bad review because it has a ton of good things going for it. However, the \"feature\" were basically the more you play, the more money taken away from you after every level is horrible. I'm at the point where I'm only getting to keep 28% of what I've earned, increasing the grind immensely. Such a terrible system to have in an otherwise solid shmup.",
